 Specialized Targets with iOS, Android, Cosmos, and Polkadot support\n\n- Add iOS target compilation (LLVM IR for iOS frameworks)\n- Add Android target compilation (LLVM IR for Android libraries)\n- Add Cosmos SDK target (WASM contract generation)\n- Add Polkadot/Substrate target (WASM runtime modules)\n- Enhance optimization passes (dead code elimination, constant folding, inlining hints)\n- Update compiler.rs with new backend modules\n- Add comprehensive documentation for all new targets\n- Create example files for iOS, Android, and Cosmos targets\n- Update CLI documentation with new target options\n- Update roadmap and status documentation\n\nPhase 3 now supports 8 compilation targets:\n- Native (LLVM IR)\n- WASM32 (WebAssembly)\n- EVM (Ethereum)\n- Solana (BPF)\n- iOS (LLVM IR)\n- Android (LLVM IR)\n- Cosmos SDK (WASM)\n- Polkadot/Substrate (WASM)","tree":{"sha":"7a4758f9863662b41c3abb632d924114f70f17cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JJ-Dynamite/JOEL/git/trees/7a4758f9863662b41c3abb632d924114f70f17cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JJ-Dynamite/JOEL/git/commits/d5003c91ec738a0ee7cf86675dde0538123eb823","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45507367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JJ-Dynamite","id":45507367,"login":"JJ-Dynamite","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTA3MzY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a