ite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JJ-Dynamite/JOEL/commits/fe79c522b68e8d832825b785466de93475436f5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T09:05:02Z","email":"joelmulammoottil994@gmail.com","name":"JJ-Dynamite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T09:05:02Z","email":"joelmulammoottil994@gmail.com","name":"JJ-Dynamite"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive documentation pages\n\nAdded extensive documentation covering:\n\nLanguage Reference:\n- Collections (lists, maps)\n- Modules and imports\n- Comments\n\nAdvanced Features:\n- Actors (concurrent programming)\n- Smart Contracts (EVM and Solana)\n- UI Components (React-like)\n- Workflows (low-code automation)\n- Deployments (container orchestration)\n- Decentralized Storage (IPFS, Filecoin, Arweave)\n\nStandard Library:\n- Built-in functions\n- Core module\n- AI module\n- Chain module\n- UI module\n- Flow module\n- Ops module\n- Storage module\n\nExamples:\n- Advanced examples\n- Web3 examples\n- UI examples\n\nGuides:\n- Best practices\n- Error handling\n- Performance tips\n- Debugging\n\nReference:\n- Grammar specification\n- Keywords list\n- Target platforms\n- FAQ\n\nAll pages properly linked in _meta.js files for navigation.\nDocumentation now comprehensive and production-ready.","tree":{"sha":"7c864750d1e476b38a7c94876eb096026a8fc21c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JJ-Dynamite/JOEL/git/trees/7c864750d1e476b38a7c94876eb096026a8fc21c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JJ-Dynamite/JOEL/git/commits/fe79c522b68e8d832825b785466de93475436f5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45507367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JJ-Dynamite/events{