 K-12 educational platform with:\n\nPhase 3: Micro-Frontend Modules\n- Complete Classroom module with live class interface\n- Assignments module with submission and grading\n- Resources module with file management\n- Analytics dashboard with performance metrics\n- Redux state management for all modules\n\nPhase 4: Testing Infrastructure\n- Vitest unit testing setup with coverage\n- Playwright E2E testing for all browsers\n- Test examples for components and Redux slices\n\nPhase 5: Build Scripts\n- Windows batch scripts (dev.bat, build.bat)\n- Unix shell scripts (dev.sh, build.sh)\n- Security audit script\n\nPhase 6: CI/CD Pipeline\n- GitHub Actions workflows for CI/CD\n- Automated testing and deployment\n- Codecov integration\n\nPhase 7: Docker & Deployment\n- Multi-stage Dockerfile\n- Docker Compose orchestration\n- Nginx configuration with security headers\n- Vercel and Netlify deployment configs\n\nPhase 8: Production Readiness\n- Sentry error tracking integration\n- Advanced code splitting and optimization\n- Security headers and CSP\n- Production environment configuration\n- Performance monitoring\n\nDatabase & Real-time:\n- 13 comprehensive SQL tables\n- Row Level Security policies for all tables\n- Real-time subscription manager\n- Edge Functions for notifications and analytics\n- Automatic triggers and database functions\n- 30+ performance indexes\n\nDocumentation:\n- DATABASE_SETUP.md - Complete database setup guide\n- REALTIME_INTEGRATION.md - Real-time usage examples\n- PRODUCTION_CHECKLIST.md - Deployment checklist\n- IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md - Full implementation details\n\n🎉 Platform is production-ready with instant live tracking!\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d79e76affd84af7609a3142abe76752ce35fd11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmedalsaei90-lang/EduConnect/git/trees/9d79e76affd84af7609a3142abe76752ce35fd11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmedalsaei90-lang/EduConnect/git