epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegesund/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pegesund","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pegesund/accounting-system/commits/63b765896295b341ca40e7ae1366e96bec54d823/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-09T14:18:37Z","email":"petter.egesund@gmail.com","name":"Petter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T14:18:37Z","email":"petter.egesund@gmail.com","name":"Petter"},"message":"Initial commit: React Micro Frontend Accounting System\n\n- Architecture: Module Federation with 6 apps (1 shell + 5 MFEs)\n- Apps:\n  - shell (port 4200): Host app with layout, routing, auth\n  - dashboard (port 4201): Overview and stats\n  - invoicing (port 4202): Invoice management\n  - expenses (port 4203): Expense tracking\n  - reports (port 4204): Financial reports\n  - clients (port 4205): Client directory\n\n- Shared packages:\n  - design-system: Reusable UI components (Button, Card, Input)\n  - shared-types: TypeScript interfaces\n  - common: Utility functions (isLoggedIn)\n\n- Tech stack:\n  - React 18.3 + TypeScript\n  - Vite + Module Federation\n  - React Router v7\n  - Tailwind CSS v4\n  - pnpm workspace\n\n- Features:\n  - Module Federation for independent MFE development\n  - Shared component library with Tailwind styling\n  - Auth context with centralized state\n  - Lazy-loaded routing for all MFEs\n  - Start/stop scripts (startme.sh, stopme.sh)\n\n- Documentation:\n  - README.md: Complete project documentation\n  - docs/architecture.md: Detailed architecture guide\n  - docs/QUICK_START.md: Quick start instructions\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d0181f1cc725fabc94e124be84cb00a5d68db68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pegesund/accounting-system/git/trees/1d0181f1cc725fabc94e124be84cb00a5d68db68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pe