t at script start\n\nThis allows script to run in both CI and local environments.","tree":{"sha":"c5a1e20b27e695e7592f191098165904cbc0190b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/c5a1e20b27e695e7592f191098165904cbc0190b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/eb1cb83fe6686d46ecaa158c8b208c4b24b0c917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/eb1cb83fe6686d46ecaa158c8b208c4b24b0c917","node_id":"C_kwDOQS0ROdoAKGViMWNiODNmZTY2ODZkNDZlY2FhMTU4YzhiMjA4YzRiMjRiMGM5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/6ffbe62a0b0e84518c042d9c8ed41829218bd0b9","sha":"6ffbe62a0b0e84518c042d9c8ed41829218bd0b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/6ffbe62a0b0e84518c042d9c8ed41829218bd0b9"}],"sha":"eb1cb83fe6686d46ecaa158c8b208c4b24b0c917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/eb1cb83fe6686d46ecaa158c8b208c4b24b0c917"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/6ffbe62a0b0e84518c042d9c8ed41829218bd0b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T23:21:55Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T23:21:55Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"message":"fix(docker): install fresh in builder, not copy\n\nProblem: ALL apps fail - Cannot find module ''fastify''\neven vettify/numeriqo/triggerra that worked before\nRoot cause: Copying node_modules between Docker stages\nbreaks pnpm workspace symlinks. Symlinks point to wrong\npaths after copy because file structure changes.\nSolution: Install fresh in builder stage AFTER copying\nall source files. This lets pnpm create proper symlinks\nin correct locations.\n\ndeps stage kept for potential layer caching benefit.","tree":{"sha":"2a97e5ccc9903c910058c1f5a482bbabb6ea476e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/2a97e5ccc9903c910058c1f5a482bbabb6ea476e"},"url":"