y (Partea 3 din Strategie Docker)\n  * Named volumes for data persistence (Partea 1 & 2 din Strategie Docker)\n  * Backing services: PostgreSQL, Kafka, Temporal, SuperTokens\n  * Observability stack: Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, OTEL Collector\n  * All 7 Control Plane services (6100-6449)\n  * All 8 stand-alone applications (6500-6899)\n- Extended timeout to 30 minutes for full stack deployment\n- Enhanced logging with container status and sample logs\n- Complete cleanup of all services\n\nValidation: Will run full 38-check validation suite including:\n- Port compliance (Tabelul 4 & 5)\n- Zero-Trust networks (4 networks)\n- Named volumes (3 volumes)\n- Health endpoints (all services)\n\nConforms to:\n- Strategii de Fișiere.env și Porturi.md (Tabelul 5)\n- Strategie Docker: Volumuri, Rețele și Backup.md (Partea 1-3)\n- GeniusERP_Suite_Plan_v1.0.5.md (F0.3 complete implementation)","tree":{"sha":"4265422558f94b23cb5884c214ddbe6b3ed2d973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/4265422558f94b23cb5884c214ddbe6b3ed2d973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/67c681d6494e3e94e5c39af4a54ef1f9c3255c69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api