, ports, networks, volumes, health)\n- smoke.sh: 33 endpoint tests\n\nF0.3.58-59: Enhanced validation\n- Port strategy compliance (Tabelul 4 & 5)\n- Zero-Trust network verification (4 networks/app)\n- Named volume checks\n\nF0.3.60: Scripts documentation (README.md)\n- 505-line usage guide\n- CI/CD integration examples\n- Troubleshooting section\n\nF0.3.61: Architecture documentation (architecture.md)\n- 658-line system overview\n- Components, data flow diagrams\n- F0.3 scope, future phases roadmap\n\nF0.3.62: Integration guide (how-to-add-new-app.md)\n- 950-line step-by-step guide\n- Code integration patterns\n- Docker Compose config (4 networks, OTEL)\n- Complete example with troubleshooting\n\nF0.3.63: Dashboards & runbooks\n- dashboards.md: Grafana guide, metrics queries\n- runbooks.md: 15 incident response procedures\n\nNetwork fixes:\n- All 8 apps with Zero-Trust network mapping\n- 4 networks: edge, suite_internal, backing_services, observability\n\nGrafana credentials:\n- Updated .observability.env (alex/superadmin)\n- Created .env symlink for Docker Compose\n\nValidation: 38/38 checks passing, 33/33 smoke tests OK","tree":{"sha":"5cdb6d8daac3e6aada0598c9d1fbf94e140438a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/5cdb6d8daac3e6aada0598c9d1fbf94e140438a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/911ce04d271f2d6e79d414c362bd025f8376328b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOC