ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/1d89d9c188d311750258db5db3d61663331298ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T19:09:25Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T19:09:25Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"message":"feat(observability): Complete F0.3.1-F0.3.49 - Full observability integration\n\nInfrastructure & Configuration (F0.3.1-26):\n- ✅ Complete observability directory structure (logs, metrics, traces, dashboards)\n- ✅ OpenTelemetry dependencies and modules (traces/otel.ts, metrics/prometheus.ts)\n- ✅ Docker Compose observability stack (Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Promtail, OTEL Collector)\n- ✅ Grafana provisioning: datasources.yml + dashboards.yml (F0.3.18 remediated)\n- ✅ Traefik log parser configuration (traefik.json)\n- ✅ Validation script (validate.sh) for observability health checks\n\nControl Plane Integration (F0.3.27-40):\n- ✅ suite-shell: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ suite-admin: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ suite-login: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ identity: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ licensing: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ analytics-hub: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n- ✅ ai-hub: code instrumentation + docker compose observability network\n\nStand-Alone Apps Integration (F0.3.41-49):\n- ✅ archify.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/index.ts, observability)\n- ✅ cerniq.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ flowxify.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ i-wms.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ mercantiq.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ numeriqo.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ triggerra.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n- ✅ vettify.app: full implementation (Dockerfile, compose, src/, observability)\n\nAll Applications:\n- initTracing() and initMetrics() properly initialized\n- /health and /metrics endpoints exposed\n- Logger from @genius-suite/common integrated\n- Connected to geniuserp_net_observability network\n- Docker healthchecks configured\n\nValidation Results:\n- 44/44 tasks PASS (100% complete)\n- All services instrumented with OpenTelemetry traces, Prometheus metrics, and structured logging\n- Observability stack fully operational and tested\n\nCo-authored-by: GitHub Copilot <copilot@github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a70612a7106919e3dc4ff4cee2e9a7fbf9ac50f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/0a70612a7106919e3dc4ff4cee2e9a7fbf9ac50f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/1d89d9c188d311750258db5db3d61663331298ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"