althcheck Standardization\n- Align identity HEALTHCHECK with suite-* services:\n  * timeout: 3s → 10s\n  * start-period: 5s → 10s\n- Add explicit healthcheck to docker-compose for all 4 CP services:\n  * cp/identity/compose/docker-compose.yml\n  * cp/suite-shell/compose/docker-compose.yml\n  * cp/suite-admin/compose/docker-compose.yml\n  * (suite-login already had explicit healthcheck)\n\n### Package Manager Compliance (pnpm only)\n- Fix identity Dockerfile to use pnpm exclusively:\n  * RUN pnpm run build (not npm run build)\n  * CMD [\"pnpm\", \"start\"] (not npm start)\n  * Remove all npm/npm ci references\n  * Use pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n\n### Results\n- All 4 CP services now have consistent HEALTHCHECK config:\n  * interval: 30s\n  * timeout: 10s\n  * start_period: 10s\n  * retries: 3\n- All services use pnpm exclusively (no npm anywhere)\n- 4/4 services have dual health verification:\n  * Explicit healthcheck in docker-compose\n  * HEALTHCHECK directive in Dockerfile\n- All health endpoints (port 3001-3005) returning 200 (JSON)\n\nReady for production deployment","tree":{"sha":"9fb65415b7d17efef70b14ef0c39bff8335ca3f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/9fb65415b7d17efef70b14ef0c39bff8335ca3f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/93fdc9ff3df1cc13ad1995ef5a693220c1500dee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/93fdc9ff3df1cc13ad1995ef5a693220c1500dee","node_id":"C_kwDOQS0ROdoAKDkzZmRjOWZmM2RmMWNjMTNhZDE5OTVlZjVhNjkzMjIwYzE1MDBkZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2","sha":"70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2"}],"sha":"93fdc9ff3df1cc13ad1995ef5a693220c1500dee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/93fdc9ff3df1cc13ad1995ef5a693220c1500dee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T18:38:37Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T18:38:37Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"message":"feat(F0.3.33): integrate observability into identity service\n\nImplements comprehensive observability integration for the identity service (Control Plane component):\n\n### Core Implementation\n- Initialize OpenTelemetry tracing at service startup\n  * Reads OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT from environment\n  * Reads OTEL_SERVICE_NAME from environment\n  * Generates trace spans for all requests\n\n- Initialize Prometheus metrics\n  * /metrics endpoint exposes metrics in text/plain format\n  * Collects default Node.js metrics\n  * Compatible with Prometheus scraping\n\n- Integrate Pino JSON logging\n  * Uses shared logger from @genius-suite/common\n  * All requests/responses logged with structured JSON format\n  * Includes timestamp, level, request ID, and request metadata\n\n### Files Created\n- cp/identity/src/main.ts: Fastify service with OTEL/Pino/Prometheus init\n- cp/identity/package.json: Dependencies for identity service\n- cp/identity/tsconfig.json: TypeScript configuration\n- cp/identity/Dockerfile: Multi-stage Docker build with pnpm\n- cp/identity/.env.identity: Working configuration\n- cp/identity/.env.identity.example: Template with comprehensive documentation\n- cp/identity/compose/docker-compose.yml: Docker Compose for local development\n\n### Dependency Management\n- Updated all dependencies to latest stable versions:\n  * @opentelemetry/api: ^1.9.0\n  * @opentelemetry/sdk-node: ^0.208.0\n  * @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node: ^0.67.0\n  * pino: ^10.1.0\n  * prom-client: ^15.1.3\n\n- Removed deprecated dependencies:\n  * glob@7.2.3 (via Jest update)\n  * inflight@1.0.6 (via Jest update)\n\n- Zero deprecated warnings in pnpm install\n\n### Validation\n- ✅ TypeScript compilation successful\n- ✅ Service starts on port 3005\n- ✅ JSON logging functional (structured logs with timestamps)\n- ✅ /health endpoint returns 200 with service status\n- ✅ /metrics endpoint exposes Prometheus metrics\n- ✅ Compatible with otel-collector, Tempo, Loki stack\n\n### Architecture Alignment\n- Uses only shared modules: @genius-suite/common, @genius-suite/observability\n- No duplicate/local implementations of Pino or Prometheus\n- Follows same pattern as suite-shell, suite-admin, suite-login\n- Production-ready configuration with environment overrides\n- Cross-cutting concerns only; business logic preserved\n\nTask Status: COMPLETE & VALIDATED","tree":{"sha":"d83e81173e4f88946b6b348b80e300b67d88eaca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/d83e81173e4f88946b6b348b80e300b67d88eaca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2","node_id":"C_kwDOQS0ROdoAKDcwZDhjZTE2MzBlNjQxYmUxZDEyNTYxNjFiNmNiN2E1YzFlMzdiYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commit/c0651ad99b4cab9649c7c423d81f97068190bbd9","sha":"c0651ad99b4cab9649c7c423d81f97068190bbd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/c0651ad99b4cab9649c7c423d81f97068190bbd9"}],"sha":"70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/70d8ce1630e641be1d1256161b6cb7a5c1e37bb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/neacisu","id":152214349,"login":"neacisu","node_id":"U_kgDOCRKbTQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/commits/c0651ad99b4cab9649c7c423d81f97068190bbd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T18:23:38Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T18:23:38Z","email":"neacsu.alex@gmail.com","name":"Alex Neacsu"},"message":"feat: implement hierarchical environment variable system for all 9 applications\n\n- Add EnvLoader utility (libs/shared/src/config/env-loader.ts) for type-safe hierarchical env loading\n- Create .env.{appname} configuration files for all 9 applications:\n  * archify.app: Document Management System (DMS)\n  * cerniq.app: Business Intelligence & Data Mesh\n  * flowxify.app: Business Process Management & iPaaS\n  * i-wms.app: Inventory & Warehouse Management\n  * mercantiq.app: E-Commerce & Marketplace\n  * numeriqo.app: Financial Management & Accounting\n  * triggerra.app: Workflow Automation & Rule Engine\n  * vettify.app: Customer & Vendor Management\n  * geniuserp.app: Unified ERP Orchestrator\n\n- Add root-level .env and cp/.env.geniussuite configurations\n- Create comprehensive environment variable templates (.env.example files)\n- Implement archify.app/src/config/env.schema.ts as Zod validation example\n- Create validate-env.sh script with full validation suite (49 checks)\n- Add comprehensive documentation (ENV-STRATEGY.md, ENV-IMPLEMENTATION-GUIDE.md)\n\nArchitecture:\n- Hierarchical loading: root → app-specific → local overrides → environment\n- Gitignored local/production files for secret management\n- Per-app feature flags and integration URLs\n- Type-safe validation with Zod schemas\n- CI/CD ready for production secret injection\n\nStatus: Phase 1 Complete - All 9 apps have full env configuration system\nValidation: 49/49 checks passed, 0 failures","tree":{"sha":"23cc6edcbe3bd19f112f4f9d0e26c9f57b487f6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/trees/23cc6edcbe3bd19f112f4f9d0e26c9f57b487f6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neacisu/GeniusERP_Suite/git/commits/c0651ad99b4cab9649c7c423d81f97068190bbd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152214349?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neacisu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neaci