andlaggare/commits/408b3214602753563807b38ffdf26744044a5a05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T05:20:36Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T05:20:36Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: log in inside gotoPortal, extend e2e coverage to all BFF endpoints and both real MFEs\n\nThe auth gate added in 7c970aa never made it into the e2e suite — gotoPortal\nonly waited for the /handlaggare response, so every test relying on the\nauthenticated view was silently broken (11 of 16 specs failing). Fixes the\nshared fixture and the one spec that inspects the pre-login dropdown state.\n\nAlso extends coverage:\n- New tasks-actions.spec.ts exercises the remaining portal-bff endpoints that\n  had no e2e coverage yet: POST /tasks/getNext, POST /tasks/{id}/unassign,\n  GET /tasks/team (including the borttagna_pga_behorighet toast).\n- New rtf-manuell-mfe.spec.ts and bekraftabeslut-mfe.spec.ts load the two real\n  regel MFEs through actual Module Federation (added as webServer entries),\n  not just the template example — mocking only their own downstream BFF calls,\n  using data shapes captured live against the local minikube backend.\n\nreassignUppgift.ts (POST /tasks/{id}/reassign) is not wired to any button in\nthe current UI, so it has no e2e coverage — flagging as dead code rather than\na gap. Komplettering is intentionally left untested — no MFE/BFF for it yet.","tree":{"sha":"61299840a3c69de106055e816809d222ddbc4b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/trees/61299840a3c69de106055e816809d222ddbc4b98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/commits/408b3214602753563807b38ffdf26744044a5a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/