ac87768082289712fe300a1287759326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:04:12Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T06:04:12Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: make the main content area scrollable, not just the nav list\n\nFLayoutLeftPanel renders the nav (containing .left-nav-custom) and the\ndefault slot (our <router-view/>) as siblings under one shared\n.layout-navigation wrapper, which is exactly the div our own\ndiv:has(.left-nav-custom) rule targets to fix the nav''s layout. Its\noverflow: hidden clips both sides, but only the nav got its own scroll\nregion (.scrollable-list) — the main content area never did, so a\nroute component taller than the viewport (e.g. the bekraftabeslut\nmicro frontend) had its lower part cut off with no way to reach it.","tree":{"sha":"54fdae81344dc234e335562e07f0ced75b26cefc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/trees/54fdae81344dc234e335562e07f0ced75b26cefc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/commits/8b03d0a9ac87768082289712fe300a1287759326","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/r