70731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U_kgDODm87aw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/commits/0b9b533c55792389ebdc1ba866a0d037e15aa2d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:48:09Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T07:48:09Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: route uppgifter by uppgiftId instead of handlaggningId (FKPOC-1022)\n\nA case can have more than one open uppgift (e.g. different regler), so\nkeying navigation and lookup on handlaggningId let two tasks collide\non the same nav route and made the second one unreachable. Routing,\nthe nav list, and the item lookup in OppnadUppgift now use uppgiftId\nthroughout; handlaggningId is still resolved and passed to the remote\nmicro frontend unchanged, since that prop contract identifies the\ncase, not the uppgift.","tree":{"sha":"6a7900ad6d9da041f8bd53135e78f4623a30b185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/trees/6a7900ad6d9da041f8bd53135e78f4623a30b185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-portal-handlaggare/git/commits/0b9b533c55792389ebdc1ba866a0d037e15aa2d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":