ate roadmap and architecture documentation\n\nThis commit addresses the following:\n\n- **Centralized Roadmap**: Created a top-level ROADMAP.md file and moved detailed roadmap information from microframe/LIMITATIONS.md into it.\n- **Documentation Links**: Updated all relevant documentation files (microframe/LIMITATIONS.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE_GLOBAL.md, docs/guides/best-practices.md, docs/authx/exceptions.md, docs/authx/dependencies.md, docs/README.md, docs/NAVIGATION.md) to link to the new central ROADMAP.md.\n- **Architecture Documentation Update (microframe/ARCHITECTURE.md)**:\n  - Updated the ''Structure des modules'' section to accurately reflect the current project layout, removing outdated references (e.g., to a non-existent ''configurations'' module) and correcting module contents (e.g., for ''ui'' and ''utils'').\n  - Integrated a new ''Architecture Globale et Intégration MicroUI'' section, including Mermaid diagrams for Layered Architecture, Request Flow, and Module Interaction (MicroFrame Core and MicroUI), to provide a more comprehensive view of the framework''s structure.\n  - Added a link to the central ROADMAP.md.\n- **Consistency and Clarity**: Enhanced overall documentation consistency and clarity by ensuring that architectural descriptions and future plans are aligned across different files.","tree":{"sha":"f5224e9b718122f37fad3fcfea15bb8515c559a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/traoreera/microframe/git/trees/f5224e9b718122f37fad3fcfea15bb8515c559a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/traoreera/microframe/git/commits/2f62ad60377c64be189a4c6afcb505bbdb4bdb98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68350805?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera/following{/