tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/traoreera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/traoreera/microframe/commits/10ab46c32d91bc2099fef70259641cf1dcf28975/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-10T12:16:33Z","email":"traoreera@gmail.com","name":"Eliezer Traore"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-10T12:16:33Z","email":"traoreera@gmail.com","name":"Eliezer Traore"},"message":"feat: Add new components for theme switching, timeline, toast, and tooltip\n\n- Implemented ThemeSwitcher component for managing themes with DaisyUI.\n- Created Timeline component for displaying a series of events.\n- Developed Toast component for notifications with customizable types and positions.\n- Added Tooltip component for displaying additional information on hover.\n\nrefactor: Enhance core extension and registration logic\n\n- Introduced a base Component class for all UI components.\n- Updated the register function to ensure components have a render method.\n\nfeat: Implement theme management with middleware and cookie support\n\n- Added ThemeManager for handling theme retrieval and setting via cookies.\n- Implemented ThemeMiddleware to inject the current theme into requests.\n- Created routes for setting and getting the current theme.\n\nfeat: Introduce various layouts for responsive design\n\n- Developed BlogLayout, DesktopLayout, EcommerceLayout, MobileLayout, and ResponsiveLayout for different use cases.\n- Integrated ThemeSwitcher and Avatar components into layouts for user personalization.\n\nchore: Add utility functions for HTML generation\n\n- Created utility functions for building class lists, HTMX attributes, links, and menu items to reduce code duplication.","tree":{"sha":"e12bf80b7a74887b7a1f05619ec3dc8207587c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/traoreera/mi